{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_016oy4n13qiY9nhPHgK6qEbB", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=37545\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=3886\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.wongnai.com/recipes/ugc/e2bf9b55f4d5473a8fe7d3970ea492f9\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.naewna.com/likesara/843419\"}, {\"url\": \"https://dk.rmutp.ac.th/upload/course/1774261629620631.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.trueplookpanya.com/knowledge/content/61424\"}, {\"url\": \"https://kuojs.lib.ku.ac.th/index.php/jstku/article/download/5143/2529\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.doa.go.th/plan/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/343.8การทดสอบพันธุ์ข้าวโพดข้าวเหนียวแบบเกษตรกรมีส่วนร่วมในพื้นที่จังหวัดพังงา.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://isancenter.msu.ac.th/wp-content/uploads/fulltext2/2025/ARS/ISAN\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=3886)\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=37545)\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:00:16.690Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"แดกงา\" ชื่อใหม่ \"ทานงา\" OR \"ข้าวเหนียวงา\" แม่ค้า เรียกให้สุภาพ", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01MT6H2Mz9vgMBNmzW8FLJbV", "content": [{"title": "ข้าวเหนียวแดกงา (กวาญย์คะเปียง) อาหารจาก “ข้าวเหนียว” ในอุษาคเนย์", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=37545"}, {"title": "ตามรอย “ขนมแดกงา” ชื่อไม่น่ากิน ทำไม่ง่าย แต่อร่อย สู่การเปลี่ยนชื่อให้ไพเราะ", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=3886"}, {"title": "1. ขนมแดกงา ขนมไทยโบราณ", "url": "https://www.wongnai.com/recipes/ugc/e2bf9b55f4d5473a8fe7d3970ea492f9"}, {"title": "www.naewna.com", "url": "https://www.naewna.com/likesara/843419"}, {"title": "dk.rmutp.ac.th", "url": "https://dk.rmutp.ac.th/upload/course/1774261629620631.pdf"}, {"title": "www.trueplookpanya.com", "url": "https://www.trueplookpanya.com/knowledge/content/61424"}, {"title": "kuojs.lib.ku.ac.th", "url": "https://kuojs.lib.ku.ac.th/index.php/jstku/article/download/5143/2529"}, {"title": "doa.go.th", "url": "https://www.doa.go.th/plan/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/343.8การทดสอบพันธุ์ข้าวโพดข้าวเหนียวแบบเกษตรกรมีส่วนร่วมในพื้นที่จังหวัดพังงา.pdf"}, {"title": "ISAN  e book (บ๊ะจ่างข้าวต้มมัด)", "url": "https://isancenter.msu.ac.th/wp-content/uploads/fulltext2/2025/ARS/ISAN -e-book (บ๊ะจ่างข้าวต้มมัด).pdf"}]}, "The search didn't find a standard polite name that vendors use for แดกงา. It did turn up two relevant articles, and neither confirms \"ทานงา\" or \"ข้าวเหนียวงา\" as the accepted replacement.\n\n- **Renaming discussion:** A Silpa Magazine article about Sukhothai's sweet treat describes it as having an unappetizing name, and discusses changing it to something more pleasing to the ear. The snippet doesn't say what the new name is, so I can't confirm whether it's one of your candidates. (https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=3886)\n- **Dish naming:** A Silpa Magazine article titled around \"ข้าวเหนียวแดกงา\" (also called กวาญย์คะเปียง) presents it as a rice dish from Southeast Asia. The snippet I saw was mostly unrelated Buddhist background, so it doesn't settle the terminology question. (https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=37545)\n\nIf you need a confirmed polite term, I'd check the full Silpa article on the Sukhothai sweet, or search for the rename that was proposed for it."], "durationSeconds": 6.649802166999998, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_016oy4n13qiY9nhPHgK6qEbB", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
